    {
      "subId": "7307602",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730760201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730760201": {
            "id": "730760201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Indeed, only in Sumeru can you truly feel nature. The air in Fontaine, by contrast, is practically toxic fumes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760202"
            ]
          },
          "730760202": {
            "id": "730760202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "What is it? Can I help you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760203"
            ]
          },
          "730760203": {
            "id": "730760203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We're just a bit curious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760204"
            ]
          },
          "730760204": {
            "id": "730760204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Do you live in this tent?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760205"
            ]
          },
          "730760205": {
            "id": "730760205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Yes, I've been living here for a while now. Oh, I get it... It's weird to see someone from Fontaine living in a tent out in the Sumeru wilds, eh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760206"
            ]
          },
          "730760206": {
            "id": "730760206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "As for why... I shall explain. But first, what are your names?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760207"
            ]
          },
          "730760207": {
            "id": "730760207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's name is Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760208"
            ]
          },
          "730760208": {
            "id": "730760208",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#I'm {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760209"
            ]
          },
          "730760209": {
            "id": "730760209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "#So, {NICKNAME} and Paimon. Noted.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760210"
            ]
          },
          "730760210": {
            "id": "730760210",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "I'm Santon. As you can see, I'm from Fontaine, and I'm here in Sumeru for the forest, of course! I love forests!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760211"
            ]
          },
          "730760211": {
            "id": "730760211",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "If you live in the city for too long, your body grows weak from the lack of exercise and your mind grows complacent.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760212"
            ]
          },
          "730760212": {
            "id": "730760212",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "Only in the vast expanse of the outdoors can you regain any sense of harmony. Forests are the best place to get re-connected to nature.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760213"
            ]
          },
          "730760213": {
            "id": "730760213",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "That's why I came to Sumeru. After all, the forests here are probably the best in Teyvat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760214"
            ]
          },
          "730760214": {
            "id": "730760214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon kinda understands, but also not really...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760215"
            ]
          },
          "730760215": {
            "id": "730760215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But with all the kinds of monsters present in them, the forests of Sumeru can be pretty dangerous...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760216"
            ]
          },
          "730760216": {
            "id": "730760216",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "That's the point!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760217"
            ]
          },
          "730760217": {
            "id": "730760217",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760218"
            ]
          },
          "730760218": {
            "id": "730760218",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "I wouldn't feel the thrill if there was no danger at all! Worry not, I'm actually a famous hunter in Fontaine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760219"
            ]
          },
          "730760219": {
            "id": "730760219",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, it's hunting in the forests that you're actually in love with!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760220"
            ]
          },
          "730760220": {
            "id": "730760220",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You're just a poacher from Fontaine, aren't you!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760223"
            ]
          },
          "730760223": {
            "id": "730760223",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "No, you've got it wrong. I'm no poacher! Poaching is a serious crime!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760224"
            ]
          },
          "730760224": {
            "id": "730760224",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "If you get caught poaching in Fontaine, your life is over. I'd never dare to do that. We Fontaine hunters deal mostly with \"fierce animals.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760225"
            ]
          },
          "730760225": {
            "id": "730760225",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Deal with fierce animals?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760226"
            ]
          },
          "730760226": {
            "id": "730760226",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "Think about it. Fierce animals coming too close to human settlements do harm to both sides, so they have to be kept away from human dwellings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760227"
            ]
          },
          "730760227": {
            "id": "730760227",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So that's what you do...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760228"
            ]
          },
          "730760228": {
            "id": "730760228",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "Yeah, this way, those who live nearby will no longer be disturbed by ferocious animals, and conversely, human activities will also cease to trouble the animals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760229"
            ]
          },
          "730760229": {
            "id": "730760229",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "To be honest, I had heard that there were some fierce animals in the vicinity, and I was hired to drive them away. I mean, as a hunter, how could I sit by, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760230"
            ]
          },
          "730760230": {
            "id": "730760230",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "Of course, I do have an interest in such creatures myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760231"
            ]
          },
          "730760231": {
            "id": "730760231",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "That overgrown gator is pretty impressive, for instance. Known to kids as the \"Gator Raja,\" it sounds like it came straight out of an urban legend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760232"
            ]
          },
          "730760232": {
            "id": "730760232",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Overgrown crocodile? Could that be the one we met before, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760233"
            ]
          },
          "730760233": {
            "id": "730760233",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "You drove the legendary Gator Raja away?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730760234"
            ]
          },
          "730760234": {
            "id": "730760234",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Santon",
            "text": "It is said that the Gator Raja is akin to an emerging giant sandbar as it rises from rushing river current, and is even capable of cutting the river's flow off! Is that true?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
